{"seq":3,"slug":"seal-unseal-auto-unseal-recovery","title":"密封解封、自动解封与灾难恢复实操","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/secrets-management-vault-dynamic-secrets-encryption/vault-storage-barrier/seal-unseal-auto-unseal-recovery","wordCount":2197,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"密封解封-自动解封与灾难恢复实操\">密封解封、自动解封与灾难恢复实操</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Vault 进程启动后处于 <strong>sealed（密封）</strong> 状态：进程能监听端口、能响应 <code>sys/seal-status</code>，但对任何 secret 路径的读写都会返回 <code>503 Vault is sealed</code>。密封不是权限控制，而是<strong>密码学上的不可用</strong>——内存里没有 master key，Barrier 无法解密物理后端里的任何条目，所以没有任何绕过路径。</p>\n<p>解开这个状态需要按顺序还原三层密钥材料（见《<a href=\"storage-backend-physical-model\">存储后端抽象与物理存储模型</a>》对物理层的描述）：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;进程启动&lt;br/&gt;sealed=true&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;seal 类型?&quot;}&#10;    B --&gt;|Shamir| C[&quot;收集 t 个 unseal key&lt;br/&gt;sys/unseal&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|auto-unseal| D[&quot;向 KMS/HSM 发起 Decrypt&lt;br/&gt;或由节点认证后自动完成&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; E[&quot;还原 master key&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;用 master key 解 keyring&lt;br/&gt;AES-256-GCM&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; G[&quot;Barrier 可用&lt;br/&gt;sealed=false&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; H[&quot;派生 root token 或&lt;br/&gt;使用已有的认证方法&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"进程启动&lt;br/&gt;sealed=true\"] --&gt; B{\"seal 类型?\"}\n    B --&gt;|Shamir| C[\"收集 t 个 unseal key&lt;br/&gt;sys/unseal\"]\n    B --&gt;|auto-unseal| D[\"向 KMS/HSM 发起 Decrypt&lt;br/&gt;或由节点认证后自动完成\"]\n    C --&gt; E[\"还原 master key\"]\n    D --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; F[\"用 master key 解 keyring&lt;br/&gt;AES-256-GCM\"]\n    F --&gt; G[\"Barrier 可用&lt;br/&gt;sealed=false\"]\n    G --&gt; H[\"派生 root token 或&lt;br/&gt;使用已有的认证方法\"]</pre><p>三层关系必须记牢：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>密钥</th>\n<th>存放位置</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>是否会轮换</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>unseal key / recovery key</td>\n<td>离线保管（Shamir 份额或 KMS 托管）</td>\n<td>解开/重建 master key</td>\n<td>unseal key 轮换时变更</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>master key</td>\n<td><strong>只在内存</strong>，从不落盘</td>\n<td>解密 keyring</td>\n<td><code>sys/rotate</code> 轮换</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>keyring（含 encryption key）</td>\n<td>Barrier 加密后写入物理后端</td>\n<td>加解密业务数据</td>\n<td>自动或手动轮换</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键推论：<strong>master key 丢失且无可用的 unseal key 集合，数据即不可恢复</strong>。备份物理后端但不备份 unseal key，等于备份一堆无法解密的密文——这是 Vault 运维事故的头号来源，官方在 <a href=\"https://developer.hashicorp.com/vault/docs/concepts/seal\">Seal/Unseal 概念文档</a> 中明确写入警告。</p>\n<h2 id=\"shamir-秘密共享与阈值实操\">Shamir 秘密共享与阈值实操</h2><p>默认 seal 用 Shamir 秘密共享把 master key 拆成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 份，任意 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 份可重构，少于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 份得不到任何信息（信息论意义上的零泄露）。份额组合数为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0px\"><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\binom{n}{t} = \\frac{n!}{t!\\,(n-t)!}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3074em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">!</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)!</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">!</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><code>init</code> 时的交互式提示如下，输出即 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 与全部份额：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"vault operator init \\&#10;  -key-shares=5 \\&#10;  -key-threshold=3 \\&#10;  -pgp-keys=&quot;alice.asc,bob.asc,carol.asc,dave.asc,erin.asc&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">vault</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> operator</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> init</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  -key-shares=5</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  -key-threshold=3</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  -pgp-keys=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"alice.asc,bob.asc,carol.asc,dave.asc,erin.asc\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三条工程约定：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 是风险与可用性的权衡。</strong> 常见工业配置是 5/3（容忍 2 份丢失，需 3 人同时在线）或 3/2（小团队）。<code>t = 1</code> 意味着任一持份者单点即可解封，只在纯自动化环境才有意义——而这种环境本就该用 auto-unseal。</li>\n<li><strong>用 <code>-pgp-keys</code> 让份额只以接收者公钥加密的形式出现。</strong> 明文份额经过终端、剪贴板、聊天工具即等于泄露；Vault 支持 PGP、HSM 与云 KMS 加密的份额输出。</li>\n<li><strong>份额分散在不同管理域。</strong> 5 份全放在同一台跳板机的 <code>/root/keys.txt</code> 是最常见的反面教材——它把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>-of-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 方案退化成了单文件。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>实时查看当前状态与进度（<code>progress</code> 显示已提交的份额数，但<strong>不显示份额内容</strong>）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"vault operator unseal -address=https://vault-1:8200   # 交互式输入单份份额&#10;vault status                                          # Seal Type / Sealed / Threshold / Progress\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">vault</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> operator</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> unseal</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -address=https://vault-1:8200</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">   # 交互式输入单份份额</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">vault</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                                          # Seal Type / Sealed / Threshold / Progress</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>vault status</code> 在无 token 时也会暴露 <code>seal_type</code>、<code>threshold</code>、<code>total_shares</code> 与版本号——这是攻击者侦察的有用信息，生产环境应把它放在内网或认证代理之后。</p>\n<h2 id=\"自动解封-kms-hsm-接管-master-key-保护\">自动解封：KMS/HSM 接管 master key 保护</h2><p>自动解封把&quot;持有 unseal key 的人&quot;替换成&quot;持有解密权限的工作负载身份&quot;。原理是用外部根密钥（KMS CMK 或 HSM 密钥）加密 master key 后写入物理后端；节点启动时调用外部服务 <code>Decrypt</code>，拿到 master key 自行解封，无需人工。</p>\n<p>HashiCorp 官方支持多种 seal 实现：<a href=\"https://developer.hashicorp.com/vault/docs/configuration/seal/awskms\">AWS KMS</a>、<a href=\"https://developer.hashicorp.com/vault/docs/configuration/seal/azurekeyvault\">Azure Key Vault</a>、<a href=\"https://developer.hashicorp.com/vault/docs/configuration/seal/gcpckms\">GCP Cloud KMS</a>、<a href=\"https://developer.hashicorp.com/vault/docs/configuration/seal/alicloudkms\">阿里云 KMS</a>、<a href=\"https://developer.hashicorp.com/vault/docs/configuration/seal/pkcs11\">PKCS#11 HSM</a> 与 <a href=\"https://developer.hashicorp.com/vault/docs/configuration/seal/transit\">Transit（另一个 Vault 集群）</a>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"hcl\" data-code=\"# vault.hcl — AWS KMS 自动解封&#10;seal &quot;awskms&quot; {&#10;  region     = &quot;ap-southeast-1&quot;&#10;  kms_key_id = &quot;arn:aws:kms:ap-southeast-1:123456789012:key/abcd-...&quot;&#10;}&#10;&#10;storage &quot;raft&quot; {&#10;  path    = &quot;/vault/data&quot;&#10;  node_id = &quot;vault-1&quot;&#10;}&#10;&#10;listener &quot;tcp&quot; {&#10;  address     = &quot;0.0.0.0:8200&quot;&#10;  tls_disable = false&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># vault.hcl — AWS KMS 自动解封</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>seal \"awskms\" {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  region     = \"ap-southeast-1\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  kms_key_id = \"arn:aws:kms:ap-southeast-1:123456789012:key/abcd-...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>storage \"raft\" {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  path    = \"/vault/data\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  node_id = \"vault-1\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>listener \"tcp\" {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  address     = \"0.0.0.0:8200\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  tls_disable = false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>启用 auto-unseal 后，<code>init</code> 的输出语义<strong>变了</strong>：不再产生 unseal key，而是产生 <strong>recovery key</strong>。两者用途完全不同：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>Shamir seal（需 unseal key）</th>\n<th>auto-unseal（需 recovery key）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>启动解封</td>\n<td>人工提交 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 份 unseal key</td>\n<td>节点自动向 KMS 请求，无需人工</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生成 root token</td>\n<td><code>vault operator generate-root</code> 需 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 份 unseal key</td>\n<td>需 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 份 <strong>recovery</strong> key</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>轮换 master key</td>\n<td><code>sys/rotate</code></td>\n<td><code>sys/rotate</code>（无需 recovery key 参与）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重建 keyring</td>\n<td><code>sys/rekey</code>（换 unseal key）</td>\n<td><code>sys/rekey-recovery-key</code>（换 recovery key）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>密封集群</td>\n<td><code>sys/seal</code></td>\n<td><code>sys/seal</code>（可用，重建需 KMS）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最易踩的坑：<strong>把 recovery key 当 unseal key 用</strong>。auto-unseal 集群里 <code>vault operator unseal</code> 不接受 recovery key，它只用于 <code>generate-root</code> 流程的份额输入；Shamir 集群里则没有 recovery key 这个概念。两者在官方 <a href=\"https://developer.hashicorp.com/vault/docs/concepts/seal#recovery-key\">Seal 概念页</a> 有专门一节，混乱会直接导致无法生成 root token 的停机。</p>\n<p>自动解封的信任模型也必须说清：<strong>KMS CMK 的访问权限就是 Vault 的最高权限</strong>。能调用该 CMK <code>Decrypt</code> 的身份可以解开任何一份加密过的 master key，从而完全控制集群。因此：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>用独立的 CMK，不与其它业务共用一个 key；</li>\n<li>通过 IAM 策略把 <code>kms:Decrypt</code> 限定到 Vault 节点的实例角色/服务账号，而不是给整个账号；</li>\n<li>开 CloudTrail / 云审计，对 CMK 的 <code>Decrypt</code> 调用告警——正常集群只在启动时调用，异常的高频调用是入侵信号；</li>\n<li>若用 <strong>Transit seal</strong>（用另一个 Vault 保护本集群），保护方自身的可用性就成了被保护集群的启动依赖，必须避免循环依赖（A 用 B 解封，B 又用 A 解封）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"密封迁移-seal-migration-与-seal-wrap\">密封迁移（Seal Migration）与 Seal Wrap</h2><p>已有集群从 Shamir 切到 auto-unseal（或反向、或换云厂商）叫 <strong>seal migration</strong>。它不是重装，而是原地把 master key 的保护方式替换掉。官方推荐路径是&quot;零停机迁移&quot;：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 1. 先启动一个仅带新 seal 配置的节点（成为 standby），此时集群暂时只信任旧 seal&#10;# 2. 用旧 unseal key 解封该节点&#10;vault operator unseal -migrate        # 关键：-migrate 让节点进入迁移模式&#10;# 3. 提交到阈值后，master key 被新 seal 重新保护&#10;# 4. 逐台重启其余节点并让它们用新 seal 启动&#10;vault operator unseal                 # 新节点走 KMS 自动解封\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 1. 先启动一个仅带新 seal 配置的节点（成为 standby），此时集群暂时只信任旧 seal</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 2. 用旧 unseal key 解封该节点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">vault</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> operator</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> unseal</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -migrate</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # 关键：-migrate 让节点进入迁移模式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 3. 提交到阈值后，master key 被新 seal 重新保护</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 4. 逐台重启其余节点并让它们用新 seal 启动</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">vault</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> operator</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> unseal</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                 # 新节点走 KMS 自动解封</span></span></code></pre></div><p>迁移期的约束：迁移过程中<strong>只能有一个 seal 处于激活态</strong>，节点会拒绝在不一致配置下加入；如果中途失败，必须用旧 unseal key 以 <code>-migrate</code> 方式恢复原状，最坏情况是停机窗口。所以迁移前必须验证：新 KMS 的连通性、IAM 权限、<code>-migrate</code> 恢复路径的演练。</p>\n<p><strong>Seal wrap</strong> 与迁移正交。为满足 FIPS 140-2 / 140-3 对密钥材料的加固要求，可把指定条目标记为 <code>SealWrap</code>（即前面存储模型里的 <code>Entry.SealWrap</code> 字段），在 Barrier 加密之外<strong>再加一层外部 seal 加密</strong>。KV、PKI、Transit 中真正保管密钥的条目会自动带上该标记；启用 HSM seal 时，密钥永不以&quot;仅 Barrier 加密&quot;的形态落盘。代价是每次访问多一次外部调用，HSM 场景延迟明显，因此只对确实是密钥材料的条目启用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"灾难恢复-快照-dr-复制与重建\">灾难恢复：快照、DR 复制与重建</h2><p>Vault 的灾难恢复有两条独立的技术路线，选错会导致 RTO 差一个数量级。</p>\n<p><strong>路线一：快照 + 还原（单集群，RTO 分钟到小时）。</strong> integrated storage 可把整个状态机导出为快照；快照内容仍是 Barrier 加密的，<strong>还原时仍需 unseal key / recovery key</strong>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"vault operator raft snapshot save backup-$(date +%F).snap&#10;vault operator raft snapshot restore -force backup-2026-10-08.snap\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">vault</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> operator</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> raft</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> snapshot</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> save</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> backup-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">date</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> +%F</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.snap</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">vault</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> operator</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> raft</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> snapshot</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> restore</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -force</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> backup-2026-10-08.snap</span></span></code></pre></div><p>还原是<strong>破坏性</strong>操作：它会覆盖当前集群的全部状态。实操要点是先在隔离环境演练 <code>restore</code>，确认密钥可解，再动生产。快照应加密后异地保存，并定期做&quot;抽一份到隔离集群还原&quot;的恢复演练——没有演练过的备份不算备份。</p>\n<p><strong>路线二：Performance Replication + Disaster Recovery Replication（跨集群，RTO 秒级）。</strong> DR 复制把 primary 的完整状态（含 keyring 与密钥材料）异步复制到 secondary。故障时把 secondary <strong>promote</strong> 成 primary：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"vault operator raft snapshot save dr.checkpoint.snap   # promote 前留一份&#10;vault write -f sys/replication/dr/secondary/promote&#10;vault read sys/replication/status                      # 确认 mode 变为 primary\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">vault</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> operator</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> raft</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> snapshot</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> save</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> dr.checkpoint.snap</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">   # promote 前留一份</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">vault</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> write</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> sys/replication/dr/secondary/promote</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">vault</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> read</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> sys/replication/status</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                      # 确认 mode 变为 primary</span></span></code></pre></div><p>promote 单向且破坏性：原 secondary 变新 primary 后，<strong>旧 primary 不能简单回切</strong>，需重建复制方向。DR 复制要求两集群 promote 前 keyring 一致，因此 secondary 也必须能解封——Shamir 场景下 unseal key 份额须在灾备站点可用（常被忽略），auto-unseal 场景下 DR 站点节点角色须有 <code>kms:Decrypt</code> 权限。</p>\n<p>恢复决策的核心是<strong>先判断密钥材料是否还在</strong>，再选路径：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>故障场景</th>\n<th>密钥材料状态</th>\n<th>推荐动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全部节点宕机、物理后端完好</td>\n<td>keyring 完整</td>\n<td>重启节点 + 解封（auto）或提交 unseal key（Shamir）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主集群整体不可用</td>\n<td>副本侧 keyring 完整</td>\n<td>promote DR secondary</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>快照完好但集群被误删</td>\n<td>keyring 在快照里</td>\n<td>新建集群 + <code>snapshot restore</code> + 用原 unseal/recovery key 解封</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>unseal key 丢失但 KMS 可用</td>\n<td>需要 CMK 权限</td>\n<td>通过 <code>sys/rekey-recovery-key</code> 重建 recovery key（仍需旧份额或 KMS）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>unseal key 与 KMS 权限同时丢失</td>\n<td><strong>不可恢复</strong></td>\n<td>无技术手段；只能从应用侧轮换所有密钥并重建</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一行是必须在设计阶段就消灭的状态。工程上的标准做法是：auto-unseal + CMK 权限由单一受管角色持有 + recovery key 使用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>-of-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 分散 + 每季度做一次&quot;从零快照还原到隔离集群&quot;的恢复演练。恢复能力是演练出来的，不是配置出来的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Vault 密封是密码学不可用状态，解开需要按 master key → keyring → Barrier 的顺序还原三层密钥材料。</li>\n<li>Shamir seal 用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>-of-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 份额保护 master key，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0px\"><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\binom{n}{t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7454em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.355em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.144em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 组合中任意 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 份可重构；份额必须分散并用 PGP/KMS 加密输出，明文份额即泄露。</li>\n<li>auto-unseal 把保护责任交给 KMS/HSM 根密钥，产生的是 <strong>recovery key</strong> 而非 unseal key，两者用途不可互换；CMK 的 <code>Decrypt</code> 权限等价于集群最高权限。</li>\n<li>Seal migration 是原地替换 master key 保护方式，<code>-migrate</code> 是唯一受支持的迁移入口，迁移期单 seal 激活。</li>\n<li>灾难恢复先判断密钥材料是否还在，再在&quot;重启解封 / promote DR / 快照还原 / rekey 重建&quot;之间选路；密钥材料与外部解密权限同时丢失是不可恢复状态，必须靠设计消灭。</li>\n<li>与轮换、HA 运维的衔接见《<a href=\"../rotation-kms-ha-ops/\">轮换、KMS 集成与高可用运维</a>》；动态密钥租约如何随解封状态失效见《<a href=\"../dynamic-secrets-leasing/\">动态密钥与租约</a>》。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"密封解封、自动解封与灾难恢复实操","id":"密封解封-自动解封与灾难恢复实操"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Shamir 秘密共享与阈值实操","id":"shamir-秘密共享与阈值实操"},{"level":2,"text":"自动解封：KMS/HSM 接管 master key 保护","id":"自动解封-kms-hsm-接管-master-key-保护"},{"level":2,"text":"密封迁移（Seal Migration）与 Seal Wrap","id":"密封迁移-seal-migration-与-seal-wrap"},{"level":2,"text":"灾难恢复：快照、DR 复制与重建","id":"灾难恢复-快照-dr-复制与重建"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Barrier 加密、根密钥层级与 Transit 加密即服务","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/secrets-management-vault-dynamic-secrets-encryption/vault-storage-barrier/barrier-encryption-key-hierarchy"},"next":{"title":"动态密钥引擎模型：数据库、PKI 与云凭据","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/secrets-management-vault-dynamic-secrets-encryption/dynamic-secrets-leasing/dynamic-secret-engines-model"}}